### Register
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Thierry",
    "email": "thierry@example.com",
    "password": "Password123",
    "currency": "USD"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "thierry@example.com",
    "password": "Password123"
}

